+            /* NEUTRON REGION READBACK: pull back only the region D2D drew. The old path
+             * (IDXGISurface1::GetDC) copied the WHOLE surface GPU->CPU and built a DIB every
+             * present -- 79-85% of present time. Falls back to it if unavailable. */
